{"sections":[{"slug":"代数-几何对偶","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"代数-几何对偶"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>–<span lang=\"zh\">几何对偶</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">观念</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"代数–几何对偶"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"观念"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>–<span lang=\"zh\">几何对偶是数学上的一大类现象</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">某种几何对象与某种代数对象之间有对偶的关系</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">取几何对象上的某种</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">函数</span>”, <span lang=\"zh\">得到代数对象</span>;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">取代数对象的</span> “"},{"Local":{"url":"/谱(代数)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">谱</span>"}},{"Plain":"”, <span lang=\"zh\">得到几何对象</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">这两个操作通常是一对</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">伴随</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">甚至是范畴等价</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在高阶范畴语境中</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>–<span lang=\"zh\">几何对偶中的</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">函数</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">表现为</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">集合值</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">甚至</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">范畴值</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的函数</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">也就是所谓</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/景上的层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">层</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<h3>Gelfand <span lang=\"zh\">对偶</span></h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/紧Hausdorff空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">紧</span> Hausdorff <span lang=\"zh\">空间</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">对偶于交换</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/C-星代数","text":"C*-<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">注意这个等价的关键原因是</span> Urysohn <span lang=\"zh\">引理保证了紧</span> Hausdorff <span lang=\"zh\">空间上有足够多的</span> $\\mathbb{C}$-<span lang=\"zh\">值连续函数</span>.</p>\n<h3>Stone <span lang=\"zh\">对偶</span></h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/pro-有限集","text":"Pro-<span lang=\"zh\">有限集</span>"}},{"Local":{"url":"/对偶(范畴论)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对偶</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">于</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Boole代数","text":"Boole <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">仿射概形</span></h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/仿射概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">仿射概形</span>"}},{"Local":{"url":"/对偶(范畴论)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对偶</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">于交换环</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这个事实可以作为仿射概形的定义</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">环上的模的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/张量-同态伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">张量</span>-<span lang=\"zh\">同态伴随</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">类比空间上的层的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/直像-逆像伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">直像</span>-<span lang=\"zh\">逆像伴随</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">淡中对偶</span></h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/淡中对偶","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">淡中</span> (Tannaka) <span lang=\"zh\">对偶</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是某种几何对象与其上的某种层范畴的对偶</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/语法–语义对偶","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">语法</span>–<span lang=\"zh\">语义对偶</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}